# Local Ollama Web UI

Read `CLAUDE.md` first, then the linked docs (`CLAUDE_ARCH.md`, `CLAUDE_UI.md`, `CLAUDE_INGEST.md`, `CLAUDE_API.md`).

- Native Ollama APIs only (`/api/chat`, `/api/tags`, `/api/show`). Never `/v1`.
- Map Thinking + Effort onto a single top-level `think` field.
- Files are extract-and-inject, not RAG.
- Keep the UI Claude-like: warm paper, Source Serif 4 for replies, no chat bubbles.
- Persist chats in SQLite under `data/`. Do not commit `data/`.
